{"id":"vod_sn_38738","vodId":"38738","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"枪神","name_cn":"枪神","date":"1998-01-01","year":"1998","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/03487986ab37bc26d0eb299f0353312d.jpg"},"summary":"《枪神》根据由内藤泰弘先生的漫画原作漫画版TRIGUN（トライガン）改编。　　故事从梅丽鲁和米丽——两位自称来自贝露那堤保险协会的少女，缉拿“世纪大飓风”的线索开始。可当她们两人遇到这个“红色衣服，金色头发，耳边还有耳环”的法修史坦毕特之后，根本无法想象他就是“传说中使一 个城市一夜间完全毁灭的危险人物，最危险的通缉犯”。这个整天叫着“LOVE＆PEACE”，爱甜甜圈如命的温柔男人怎么可能就是罪大恶极的法修。之后的旅行中他们互相照顾，帮助和保护了不少有困难的人，共同度过了不少险情，成为了很好的朋友。一切的平和直到GUNG-HO-GUNS的出现，一切都发生了改变，法修甚至开了杀戒。这个“与以灭绝人类为己任”超级杀手集团GUNG-HO-GUNS到底和法修有什么关系？他们又将面临怎样的挑战？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7BXgsPhAAU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7fyV88k9Nw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qitYMXtQ3F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Bcs4495Avb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/75Hc2U2RQ71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Y1RUEqRfu11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6KMjFbuK721/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yCmyRfj2Rg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TtXYK4RSBp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RQRp9M6QLn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pAn3hgxzLw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sr5wNTGsdW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v7FMiPJ06Z1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/